        "t": 633.914756,
        "r": 513.1537020000001,
        "b": 608.0631449281769
      },
      "content": "To avoid damage around the protruded part of machine, the task should be performed by two persons, of which one is a supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0343",
      "reading_order": 448,
      "section": "3-2. Fork Lift",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.99913000000002,
        "t": 599.894852,
        "r": 372.7143839999994,
        "b": 591.0231329281769
      },
      "content": "Put down the machine slowly not to give a shock on the floor."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0344",
      "reading_order": 449,
      "section": "3-2. Fork Lift",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.99913000000002,
        "t": 578.955056,
        "r": 356.03208600000016,
        "b": 570.0833369281769
      },
      "content": "Hold wood between the forklift and the machine for lifting."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
